      "resolution": "Rust uses borrowed serde_json RawValue syntax validation with strict UTF8/BOM/size guards and string-aware depth64 counting, retaining exact JSON bytes. Independent large-number, internal-looking object-key, escaped-container and depth64/65 cases agree with managed parsing."
